---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>Hiking — Olivia Fjord Sloth</title>
	</head>

	<body>
		<header>
			<a class="name" href="/">OLIVIA FJORD SLOTH</a>

			<nav>
				<a href="/stories">Stories</a>
				<a class="active" href="/hiking">Hiking</a>
				<a href="/talks">Talks</a>
				<a href="/about">About</a>
			</nav>
		</header>

		<main>

			<section class="hero">
				<p class="eyebrow">HIKING</p>

				<h1>Notes from the trail.</h1>

				<p class="intro">
					Routes I’ve walked, GPX files, food, planning and the things
					I’ve learned by actually being out there.
				</p>
			</section>


			<section class="guide-grid">

				<a class="guide-card" href="/hiking/trails">
					<img src="/hiking/trails.jpg" alt="Mountain hiking trail" />

					<div class="guide-content">
						<p class="label">ROUTES</p>
						<h2>Trails I’ve walked</h2>
						<p>
							Routes, GPX files and my own notes from hikes in places
							like Kyrgyzstan, Tajikistan and Iran.
						</p>
						<span>Explore trails →</span>
					</div>
				</a>


				<a class="guide-card" href="/hiking/food">
					<img src="/hiking/food.jpg" alt="Food for hiking" />

					<div class="guide-content">
						<p class="label">TRAIL FOOD</p>
						<h2>What I eat on long hikes</h2>
						<p>
							Dehydrated meals, what works for me and what I actually
							carry when I’m out for several days.
						</p>
						<span>Trail food →</span>
					</div>
				</a>


				<a class="guide-card" href="/hiking/planning">
					<img src="/hiking/map.jpg" alt="Map and hiking planning" />

					<div class="guide-content">
						<p class="label">PLANNING</p>
						<h2>Maps, GPX and planning</h2>
						<p>
							The websites, apps and small tricks I use when planning
							a route somewhere I haven’t been before.
						</p>
						<span>Planning notes →</span>
					</div>
				</a>

			</section>

		</main>
	</body>
</html>


<style>

	* {
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	html,
	body {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		background: #f4f1ea;
		color: #171717;
	}

	body {
		font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
	}

	a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	header {
		padding: 30px 48px;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.name {
		font-size: 22px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}

	nav {
		display: flex;
		gap: 28px;
	}

	nav a {
		font-size: 15px;
	}

	nav .active {
		border-bottom: 1px solid #171717;
	}

	.hero {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 100px auto 100px;
		padding: 0 48px;
	}

	.eyebrow,
	.label {
		margin: 0 0 20px;
		font-size: 11px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: clamp(70px, 9vw, 130px);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 0.92;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}

	.intro {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 40px 0 0;
		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: clamp(23px, 2.6vw, 34px);
		line-height: 1.4;
		color: #555;
	}

	.guide-grid {
		max-width: 1400px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 48px 130px;

		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 35px;
	}

	.guide-card img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	.guide-content {
		padding-top: 22px;
	}

	.guide-content h2 {
		margin: 0 0 14px;
		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: 34px;
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.05;
	}

	.guide-content > p:not(.label) {
		margin: 0 0 18px;
		font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
		font-size: 17px;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: #555;
	}

	.guide-content span {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 700;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #171717;
		padding-bottom: 3px;
	}

	.guide-card:hover img {
		opacity: 0.93;
	}

	@media (max-width: 800px) {

		header {
			padding: 24px 20px;
		}

		.name {
			font-size: 17px;
		}

		nav {
			gap: 12px;
		}

		nav a {
			font-size: 12px;
		}

		.hero {
			margin: 60px auto 70px;
			padding: 0 24px;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 62px;
		}

		.intro {
			font-size: 22px;
		}

		.guide-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			padding: 0 24px 90px;
			gap: 70px;
		}

		.guide-card img {
			aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
		}
	}

</style>